pvr"], "long_description": "\ud83e\udd6a Welcome to Chimp Panini! \ud83e\udd6a\n\nThink you\u2019ve got the speed to handle the press? Chimp Panini takes the classic VR physics-movement formula and turns up the heat!\n\nJump into lobbies with friends, master crazy momentum leaps, and swing through custom-built maps built for competitive tag and chill hangout sessions alike. We\u2019re constantly updating the game with new cosmetics, feature drops, and map expansions.\n\nWhat to expect:\n\ud83c\udfc3 Fluid Mechanics: Tight, responsive hand-movement physics.\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Cosmetics & Customization: Show off your style in the city center.\n\n\ud83d\udc12 Community Driven: Regular updates, events, and bug fixes based on community feedback.\n\nGrab your headset, jump in, and don't get toasted!", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd6a Welcome to Chimp Panini! \ud83e\udd6a\n\nThink you\u2019ve got the speed to handle the press? Chimp Panini takes the classic VR physics-movement formula and turns up the heat!\n\nJump into lobbies with friends, master crazy momentum leaps, and swing through custom-built maps built for competitive tag and chill hangout sessions alike. We\u2019re constantly updating the game with new cosmetics, feature drops, and map expansions.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQ16FhqSaHUikP6RuR1achPZtKcNs8fJoxOtbXmNwHQqxXr63Y3Q4HmVE0On8ljMAB2TfPbbFgDp60Z/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unded Studios ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQF502n4riDEVaKRafSAYIL2Q4Aq4O6QVrCzoCn5sYJ-JVjEBdgr1l9srl_Ko4m1VumAD9CSWM-ngB1/pub", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_t